VxcjEmduzxSaD08pxVx3FGX4CGzPkEDhFsnnFw&oe=6AFF1387"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gala Relax", "keywords": ["galarelax", "relax", "360", "nature", "ambient"], "long_description": "Your quiet place, one scene away.\n\nGala Relax, rebuilt for Meta Quest, puts you inside calming views: waves rolling onto a Hawaiian beach, waterfalls, city skylines at dusk, coral reefs, the coastline from the air. Each scene wraps all around you and loops without a seam, so you can stay as long as you need.\n\n- Seven collections, plus 3D scenes with real depth\n- Download your favorites and unwind offline\n- Seated or standing, no motion, nothing to learn\n- Touch controllers\n\nThe first scene in every collection is free. Go Premium to unlock them all, with a 7-day free trial. Cancel any time in your Meta account.\n\nPurchases from the earlier Gear VR / Go app do not carry over.", "short_description": "Step into the calm. Surf rolling onto a Hawaiian beach, reefs drifting past, the coast from above: 360-degree scenes that wrap all around you and loop for as long as you like. Start free, then unlock every scene with a 7-day free trial."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "STW Software Limited", "support_website_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/support", "website_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["